{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moon Drop Miners is a high-stakes resource management roguelite about building and optimizing a fragile mining operation on unstable moons.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502510/extras/74c178c695865144e07d226698ed11dc.poster.avif?t=1774048210\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502510/extras/74c178c695865144e07d226698ed11dc.webm?t=1774048210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502510/extras/74c178c695865144e07d226698ed11dc.mp4?t=1774048210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Build and Balance</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Slam down structures and watch your resource numbers rise or plummet. Every structure you drop can boost intake or push your rig to the brink of collapse. It\u2019s all about balancing resources to keep your rig operational and your moon in one piece. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Placement:</strong> Each structure has unique benefits and risks, gaining bonuses or penalties for their place in your rig. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chain Reactions:</strong> Clever layouts can trigger powerful synergies or disastrous meltdowns. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Tightrope :</strong> Power your structures and mine resources without letting Stability drop below critical levels, or risk catastrophic failure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502510/extras/36b6a4cd0ae4b480bf00f5122c83aac8.poster.avif?t=1774048210\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502510/extras/36b6a4cd0ae4b480bf00f5122c83aac8.webm?t=1774048210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502510/extras/36b6a4cd0ae4b480bf00f5122c83aac8.mp4?t=1774048210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Survive and Optimize</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision counts as quotas rise and pressure mounts. Expand too slowly and fall behind or push too hard and risk total collapse. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rising Quotas:</strong> Extract enough Celestium or lose your contract for good. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk vs. Reward:</strong> Overextend for bigger gains, or play it safe and fall behind. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptive Strategy:</strong> Reevaluate your approach as quotas rise and cosmic hazards throw a wrench in your plans.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502510/extras/ace313830f3bc440f49a29820bf826c7.poster.avif?t=1774048210\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502510/extras/ace313830f3bc440f49a29820bf826c7.webm?t=1774048210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502510/extras/ace313830f3bc440f49a29820bf826c7.mp4?t=1774048210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade and Expand</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn cash and discover new ways to power up your rig. From game altering unlocks to specialized satellites, every improvement helps you delve deeper, extract more, and meet your next quota. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satellite Support:</strong> Equip specialized orbiters that grant unique bonuses and triggers that  dramatically alter how you build your rig. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash Your Potential:</strong> Combine upgrades to create unstoppable mining synergies. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock More Options:</strong> Between runs unlock more structures to build, satellites to acquire, and moons to mine.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502510/extras/7d930937afd86267ddcdc5cd987aa280.poster.avif?t=1774048210\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502510/extras/7d930937afd86267ddcdc5cd987aa280.webm?t=1774048210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502510/extras/7d930937afd86267ddcdc5cd987aa280.mp4?t=1774048210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replayability</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>75 Structures, Each with 2 Upgrades</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>75 Satellites</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 Distinct Moons</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 Difficulty Levels</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Synthwave Space Rock Soundtrack  </strong> <br><strong>  </strong> </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3502510?t=1774048210","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.s