 Miners is a high-stakes resource management roguelite where you drop structures onto unstable moons to build and balance a fragile mining operation. Balance Energy and Stability while extracting enough Celestium to meet quota... Or watch your entire operation collapse.","steam_appid":3502510,"support_info":{"email":"chipMicroMedia@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":null}